{"text": "Alice went back to the table and found a little bottle that had not been there before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A paper label around its neck said DRINK ME in large letters. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Wise little Alice first checked if it was marked poison, but it was not. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It tasted of cherry tart, custard, pineapple, roast turkey, toffee, and hot buttered toast. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She very soon finished it off and said, What a curious feeling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was shutting up like a telescope, and soon she was only ten inches high. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now she was just the right size to go through the little door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But at the door, Alice realized that the golden key was still on the table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was now too small to reach it, so she sat down and cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come, there is no use in crying like that, she told herself sharply. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she found a little glass box under the table, with a tiny cake inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The words EAT ME were written on it in currants, and very soon Alice finished off the cake.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "l", "i", "c", "e", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "a", "b", "l", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "b", "o", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "b", "e", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", " ", "p", "a", "p", "e", "r", " ", "l", "a", "b", "e", "l", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "n", "e", "c", "k", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "D", "R", "I", "N", "K", " ", "M", "E", " ", "i", "n", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", 